For multiples of three, output "Fizz".
 For multiples of five, output "Buzz".
 For multiples of both three and five, output "FizzBuzz".
 Example:
 Input: n = 15
 Output: ["1", "2", "Fizz", "4", "Buzz", "Fizz", "7", "8", "Fizz", "Buzz", "11", "Fizz", "13", "14", "FizzBuzz"]

 
int fb = 20;

for(int i =1;i<=fb;i++){
  if(i % 3 == 0 && i % 5 == 0){
    print('fizz buzz');
  }else if ( i % 3 == 0){
    print('fizz');
  }else if(i % 5 == 0){
    print('buzz');

} else{
print(i);
}
